OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FShowers
OL,6,Fcontinuing in the west but easing
OL,7,Fthrough the evening. The east will see
OL,8,Fshowers later in the night, with a
OL,9,Frisk of these being heavy or thundery
OL,10,Fin places. A mild night to come.
OL,11,
OL,12,CWednesday:FA cloudy start but skies
OL,13,Fquickly turning brighter, some showers
OL,14,Fdeveloping by later morning into the
OL,15,Fafternoon. These may be potentially
OL,16,Fheavy or thundery in places. Warmer
OL,17,Fthan Tuesday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
